# Rule: Training Change Protocol
# Scope: mainrun/**/*.py, Taskfile.yml, docs/**
For each change:
1) Suggest a branch name `exps/<NN>-<short>`.
2) Apply exactly one change (smallest diff).
3) Provide `task train` as the run command.
4) Provide a `task snapshot ...` command filling placeholders.
5) Provide a ready-to-paste CHANGELOG block + one Conventional Commit message.
